# tcrsift canonical mouse (Mus musculus) TCR constant-region AA sequences.
#
# Runtime source for `MOUSE_TRAC_AA`, `MOUSE_TRBC1_AA`, `MOUSE_TRBC2_AA`, and
# `MOUSE_CONSTANT_REGIONS_AA` in `tcrsift.assemble`.
#
# Sourced from Ensembl GRCm39 release 112 canonical transcripts and verified
# against UniProtKB:
#   - TRAC  (Trac,  ENSMUST00000198398, UniProt P01849, 136 aa)
#   - TRBC1 (Trbc1, ENSMUST00000192856, UniProt P01852, 172 aa)
#   - TRBC2 (Trbc2, ENSMUST00000103299, UniProt A0A075B5J4, 172 aa)
#
# All three sequences are BARE MATURE protein (leading splice-boundary 'X'
# stripped). The J->C junction residue (universally E for beta chains;
# J-dependent N/Y/D/H for alpha chains) is read per-clone from the CellRanger
# contig or inferred from `MOUSE_TRAJ_JUNCTION_RESIDUES` at assembly time.

